  (text "R-LED-PD holds the input low through the bootloader window: GPIO1 floats, OE is tied low,\nand a floating AHCT input would put clean 5 V edges into the strip before firmware runs.\nBI is grounded at the head of the strip; from the second pixel on, BI comes from inside the tape.\nGates B-D are spare: inputs and enables tied low (an enabled CMOS gate never floats)." (at 20.32 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid c38742d7-7562-55bf-be34-e9af44b385d2))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
